Q: MySQL connection error I am trying to execute the following PHP script (called test1.php, say) on a web server running Apache. The script tries to connect to a MySQL server:
===============================================
$myHost = "localhost";

$myUser = "anyone";

$myPwd = "1234";

$link = mysql_connect($myHost,$myUser,$myPwd);

if (!$link) {

die(mysql_errno().": ".mysql_error()."\n");

}

echo "Connected successfully.\n";

================================================
I kept receiving errors like this:
2002: Can't connect to local MySQL

